.TH mouser-help 1  "mouser-help 1.3.0" 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH NAME
mouser\-help \- Show a help topic: the guides in docs/, built in (`mouser help` lists them, `mouser help search WORDS` finds them; a command name shows its usage); see docs/help.md
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmouser help\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIARGS\fR] 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show a help topic: the guides in docs/, built in (`mouser help` lists them, `mouser help search WORDS` finds them; a command name shows its usage); see docs/help.md
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIARGS\fR]
Topic id (`models`, `mcp`, …), a command name, or `search` and words
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBmouser\fR(1)
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH VERSION
v1.3.0
